{"t_ms": 16595265, "conversation_id": "conv_fixed_early_proxy_s4_022", "turn_id": 1, "actor": "system", "event_type": "retrieval_result", "payload": {"passages": ["Kids Menu\n\nGrand Horizon Hotel & Suites\n\nA dedicated children's menu is available at the Horizon Restaurant and through room service. Popular options include mini pizzas, pasta, sandwiches, fruit bowls, fresh juices, and healthy snacks. Parents may request customized meals for children with dietary restrictions or allergies by informing the restaurant staff in advance.", "Rooftop Restaurant\n\nGrand Horizon Hotel & Suites\n\nThe Skyline Rooftop Restaurant offers panoramic city views along with a fine dining experience. It operates daily from 6:30 PM to 11:00 PM. The menu features grilled specialties, seafood, Indian cuisine, and handcrafted desserts. Advance reservations are recommended, especially during weekends and festive seasons.", "Main Restaurant Timings\n\nGrand Horizon Hotel & Suites\n\nThe Horizon Restaurant serves breakfast, lunch, and dinner daily. Lunch is available from 12:30 PM to 3:00 PM, while dinner is served between 7:00 PM and 10:30 PM. Reservations are recommended during weekends and public holidays. Smart casual attire is encouraged for all guests dining in the restaurant."], "scores": [0.7223259210586548, 0.783682107925415, 0.7870383262634277], "filenames": ["27_kids_menu.txt", "25_rooftop_restaurant.txt", "22_restaurant.txt"], "timing_policy": "fixed_early_proxy", "timing_trigger": "fixed_early_proxy", "user_end_known_at_finish": true, "launch_offset_ms_vs_user_end": 71, "overlap_with_speech_ms": 0, "forecast_invalidated": false}}
